              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">This dataset belongs to the article \"Constant Value Added Share Analysis: A Novel Trade Decomposition Technique with an Application to the Philippines\" published in <i>Economies</i> (<a href=\"https://www.mdpi.com/2227-7099/12/7/173).\" target=\"_blank\">https://https://www.mdpi.com/2227-7099/12/7/173).</a> The dataset contains consolidated value added trade data for the Philippines and the world (75 other economies) based on the latest Trade in Value Added (TiVA) database 2023 version. It includes manufacturing gross exports and domestic value added data from the first year (1995) until the last available year (2020).</p><p><br></p>"
                }
              }
            ]
